kampung.png is drawn in code by scripts/art/build_art.py: the attap stilt
houses, the kopitiam, the provision shop, the wet-market stall, the well, the
notice board, the lorry and its stop sign, coconut palms, a banana plant, the
sampan, sea, shore and sand tiles, the jetty, the lorry stop's laterite, farm
beds, kangkong at three stages, a window glow and a sleeper's "z".

The colours are picked to sit beside the CC0 Ninja Adventure pieces in
../ninja-adventure/ (see its CREDITS).
